# #2340 finding 1: a rotation must carry the rekeys of every descendant above a
# directly granted container, or a writer granted only further down would wait
# on another device's write. The API refuses one that does not with the new
# `container_descendant_rekeys_required` code, and an inline repair refused for
# the same reason fails its write with `document_sync_descendant_rekeys_required`.
# Greenfield flag day: servers and every client are wiped and redeployed
# together, so no client written against the previous contract survives.
# Remove after merge to main.
POST /containers added `subschema #1, subschema #2` to the `anyOf[subschema #1]/code` response property `anyOf` list for the response status `409`
POST /containers/with-metadata-document added `subschema #1, subschema #2` to the `anyOf[subschema #1]/code` response property `anyOf` list for the response status `409`
DELETE /containers/{containerId} added `subschema #1, subschema #2` to the `anyOf[subschema #1]/code` response property `anyOf` list for the response status `409`
POST /containers/{containerId}/move added `subschema #1, subschema #2` to the `anyOf[subschema #1]/code` response property `anyOf` list for the response status `409`
POST /containers/{containerId}/recite added `subschema #1, subschema #2` to the `anyOf[subschema #1]/code` response property `anyOf` list for the response status `409`
POST /containers/{containerId}/rekey added `subschema #1, subschema #2` to the `anyOf[subschema #1]/code` response property `anyOf` list for the response status `409`
POST /containers/{containerId}/revoke added `subschema #1, subschema #2` to the `anyOf[subschema #1]/code` response property `anyOf` list for the response status `409`
POST /containers/{containerId}/share added `subschema #1, subschema #2` to the `anyOf[subschema #1]/code` response property `anyOf` list for the response status `409`
POST /documents added the new `document_sync_descendant_rekeys_required` enum value to the `code/anyOf[subschema #2]/` response property for the response status `404`
POST /documents added the new `document_sync_descendant_rekeys_required` enum value to the `code/anyOf[subschema #2]/` response property for the response status `409`
POST /documents/{documentId}/link added the new `document_sync_descendant_rekeys_required` enum value to the `code/anyOf[subschema #2]/` response property for the response status `404`
POST /documents/{documentId}/link added the new `document_sync_descendant_rekeys_required` enum value to the `code/anyOf[subschema #2]/` response property for the response status `409`
GET /documents/{documentId}/purge added the new `document_sync_descendant_rekeys_required` enum value to the `code/anyOf[subschema #2]/` response property for the response status `404`
GET /documents/{documentId}/purge added the new `document_sync_descendant_rekeys_required` enum value to the `code/anyOf[subschema #2]/` response property for the response status `409`
POST /documents/{documentId}/purge added the new `document_sync_descendant_rekeys_required` enum value to the `code/anyOf[subschema #2]/` response property for the response status `404`
POST /documents/{documentId}/purge added the new `document_sync_descendant_rekeys_required` enum value to the `code/anyOf[subschema #2]/` response property for the response status `409`
